      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a strong pitch. It's exactly the kind of energy Lumina wants to see. One thing though—they've been asking some pretty specific questions about his recent engagement dip during that controversy last month. If they dig into the raw analytics, they might notice the numbers looked a bit shaky for a few weeks. How should we frame that period so it doesn't kill the momentum of this pitch?",
